1
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:11,000
Nowhere is safe.

2
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:16,000
Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows: Part 1 is a
adventure, fantasy film directed by David Yates.

3
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:21,000
Harry, Ron and Hermione walk away from their last year at Hogwarts to find and destroy the
remaining Horcruxes, putting an end to Voldemort's bid for immortality.

4
00:24:20,000 --> 00:24:26,000
But with Harry's beloved Dumbledore dead and Voldemort's unscrupulous Death
Eaters on the loose, the world is more dangerous than ever.

5
00:30:25,000 --> 00:30:31,000
Harry Potter, played by Daniel Radcliffe.

6
00:36:30,000 --> 00:36:36,000
Hermione Granger, played by Emma Watson.

7
00:42:35,000 --> 00:42:41,000
Ron Weasley, played by Rupert Grint.

8
00:48:40,000 --> 00:48:46,000
Dobby (voice), played by Toby Jones.

9
00:54:45,000 --> 00:54:51,000
Bellatrix Lestrange, played by Helena Bonham Carter.

10
01:00:50,000 --> 01:00:56,000
Severus Snape, played by Alan Rickman.

11
01:06:55,000 --> 01:07:01,000
Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows – Part 1 is a 2010 fantasy film
directed by David Yates from a screenplay by Steve Kloves.

12
01:13:00,000 --> 01:13:06,000
The first of two cinematic parts based on the 2007 novel
Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows by J.

13
01:19:05,000 --> 01:19:11,000
Rowling, it is the sequel to Harry Potter and the Half-Blood Prince (2009)
and the seventh instalment in the Harry Potter film series.

14
01:25:10,000 --> 01:25:16,000
The film stars Daniel Radcliffe as Harry Potter, with Rupert Grint and Emma Watson,
respectively, reprising roles as Harry's best friends Ron Weasley and Hermione Granger.

15
01:31:15,000 --> 01:31:21,000
The story follows Harry Potter, who has been asked by Dumbledore to find and
destroy Lord Voldemort's secret to immortality – the Horcruxes.

16
01:37:20,000 --> 01:37:26,000
Filming began on 19 February 2009 and was completed on 12 June 2010.

17
01:43:25,000 --> 01:43:31,000
It was released in 2D cinemas and IMAX formats in the United Kingdom and
in the United States on 19 November 2010, by Warner Bros.

18
01:49:30,000 --> 01:49:36,000
The film received positive reviews with critics praising the
performances, cinematography, visual effects and musical score.

19
01:55:35,000 --> 01:55:41,000
In the film's worldwide opening weekend, Part 1 grossed $330 million, the third-highest in the
series, and the highest opening of 2010, as well as the eighth-highest of all time.

20
02:01:40,000 --> 02:01:46,000
With a worldwide gross of $960 million, Part 1 became the third-highest-grossing film of 2010, the tenth highest-grossing
film of all time at the time  and the third-highest-grossing Harry Potter film in terms of worldwide totals.

21
02:07:45,000 --> 02:07:51,000
The film was nominated for many awards, including the Academy
Award for Best Art Direction and Best Visual Effects.

22
02:13:50,000 --> 02:13:56,000
The film was followed by the concluding entry, Harry Potter
and the Deathly Hallows – Part 2 in 2011.

23
02:19:55,000 --> 02:20:01,000
The film explores themes of witch, friendship,
london, england, corruption, escape.
